<p>You can register the current settings as a one click preset with its 
 name and comment.</p>
<p>The <img alt="" class="help-icon" height="16" loading="lazy" src="~/images/help/NOT_SHARED_ICON.gif" width="16"/> icon is displayed on the registered one click preset.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot register new one click presets if the 
 Administrator prohibits users from registering them.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="name" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">One Click Preset Name:</span></p>
<p>Enter a name for the new one click preset.</p>
<p>The name can be up to 128 single-byte or 64 double-byte characters.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="comment" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Comment:</span></p>
<p>Enter a comment for the new one click preset.</p>
<p>The comment can be up to 512 single-byte or 256 double-byte characters. 
 You can insert line breaks.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the entries and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Cancels the entries.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
